{"id":"nave:elishama","source":"nave","name":"Elishama","slug":"elishama","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. Grandfather of Joshua Nu 1:10; 2:18; 7:48,53; 10:22; 1Ch 7:26","refs":[["Num",1,10,1,10],["Num",2,18,2,18],["Num",7,48,7,48],["Num",7,53,7,53],["Num",10,22,10,22],["1Chr",7,26,7,26]]},{"text":"2. A son of David 2Sa 5:16; 1Ch 3:8; 14:7","refs":[["2Sam",5,16,5,16],["1Chr",3,8,3,8],["1Chr",14,7,14,7]]},{"text":"3. Another son of David, elsewhere called ELISHUA, which see 1Ch 3:6","refs":[["1Chr",3,6,3,6]]},{"text":"4. A descendant of Judah 1Ch 2:41","refs":[["1Chr",2,41,2,41]]},{"text":"5. Probably identical with number four 2Ki 25:25; Jer 41:1","refs":[["2Kgs",25,25,25,25],["Jer",41,1,41,1]]},{"text":"6. A secretary to Jehoiakim Jer 36:12","refs":[["Jer",36,12,36,12]]},{"text":"7. A priest sent by Jehoshaphat to teach the law 2Ch 17:8","refs":[["2Chr",17,8,17,8]]}],"refCount":15}
